        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/timberlake-33905"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s roots trace back to colonial times, with Campbell County’s early settlement shaping its development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/timberlake-33905"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Timberlake Marina began as a modest residential spot and grew into a key local hub for boating and recreation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-places-to-visit-in-timberlake-nature-adventure-and-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Timberlake Nature Trail evolved from a historic trail network used by early residents, now a beloved walking path.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-places-to-visit-in-timberlake-nature-adventure-and-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Timberlake Park, established in the early 20th century, offers a quiet escape amid the town’s natural beauty.",
